# FX Hedging

## Overview

This capability demonstrates my ability to evaluate foreign exchange risk and compare hedging strategies.

## Scenario

A U.S. landing-gear manufacturer expects to receive EUR 10,500,000 from a French aircraft manufacturer in 365 days.

## Methods

- Forward contracts
- Money-market hedges
- Currency put options
- Excel financial modeling
- Independent model validation

## Project Deliverables

- Stage 1: Executive Brief
- Stage 2: Model Specification (`spec.md`)
- Stage 3: Excel Model (`model.xlsx`) and Build Audit
- Stage 4: Market Data
- Stage 5: Validation and Decision Memo
